    C --> D[Carnitine Transport]
    D --> E[Mitochondrial Import]
    E --> F[β-Oxidation Cycle]
    F --> G[Acetyl-CoA Production]
    G --> H[TCA Cycle Entry]
    H --> I[Energy Production]
    I --> J[Fatty Acid Oxidation Complete]
    
