    P -->|Low| R[Oxidation Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    S[Carnitine Palmitoyltransferase I] --> B
    T[Carnitine Acyltransferase] --> D
    U[β-Oxidation Enzymes] --> F
    V[Carnitine] --> D
    W[Acetyl-CoA] --> G
    X[Peroxisomal Enzymes] --> M
    
